      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Human Review (sub-workflow)\nCalled by **document-agent** whenever the AI is not sure: low confidence, missing fields, or unclear income vs expense.\n\nRuns separately, so the main workflow keeps processing other files while this one waits.\n\n**Approve** - reviewer-corrected data is logged to Income or Expenses, file moves to Processed.\n**Reject** - logged in the Review Log tab, file moves to Rejected.\n**No reply in 24h** - nothing is logged, reviewer is alerted, file moves to Needs Review.",
